# shell: desktop
# prefs: factory
# setup: sdrlog
# open: /tmp/trk_home/recordings
# TikuSDR as a spectrum analyser on a recording, which needs no board:
# trace 2 made a max hold from the Traces lists, its legend in red; marker
# 1 out on the highest peak by its key, Next Peak moving it down, the
# Marker menu's Peak Search back up, the n key down again, and a drag let
# go beside the highest peak climbing onto it; the Spectrogram switch off,
# the spectrum taking its room; About TikuSDR, put away by a key.
wait 20
click-row 0
wait 2
click-row 0
wait 150
expect-title TikuSDR
wait 300
note The waterfall stays visible while its settings section is collapsed
expect-pixel 400 200 000060
note Inspect a retained waterfall row without retuning the recording
press 800 63 1 alt
release 800 63 1 alt
wait 8
expect-pixel 800 63 336698
shot /tmp/trk_sdr_history.png
click 71 8
wait 4
expect-menu Return to Latest
menu-pick Return to Latest
wait 6
note Trace 2 a max hold, from the lists: its legend in red
click 172 239
wait 4
key Down
key Return
wait 4
click 172 263
wait 4
key Down
key Down
key Down
key Return
wait 10
expect-pixel 932 265 d23228
note Marker 1 out on the highest peak; Next Peak, Peak Search, n
click-window TikuSDR
key m
wait 10
expect-pixel 840 286 466058
note Expand Markers; Traces folds to keep its controls inside the window
click 80 339
wait 4
click 190 354
wait 10
shot /tmp/trk_sdranalyser.png
expect-pixel 828 286 466058
click 211 8
wait 8
menu-pick Peak Search
wait 10
expect-pixel 840 286 466058
click-window TikuSDR
key n
wait 10
expect-pixel 828 286 466058
note A drag let go beside the highest peak climbs onto it
press 828 400
wait 4
move 700 400
wait 4
release 838 400
wait 10
expect-pixel 840 286 466058
note The spectrogram off: the graticule starts at the top
click 80 441
wait 4
click 209 299
wait 10
expect-pixel 209 299 ffffff
expect-pixel 840 95 466058
note Manual reference level disables automatic spectrum scaling
click 155 371
key 1
key 2
key 0
key Return
wait 4
expect-pixel 209 347 ffffff
note Seek after playback ends, then step and change playback speed
click 500 586
wait 10
click 114 8
wait 4
expect-menu Next Frame
menu-pick Next Frame
wait 10
click 114 8
wait 4
expect-menu Speed: 1x (Cycle)
menu-pick Speed: 1x (Cycle)
wait 4
shot /tmp/trk_sdr_navigation.png
note About TikuSDR, hoisted into the Tiku menu: the splash's card, finished
click 20 8
wait 8
expect-menu About TikuSDR
menu-pick About TikuSDR
wait 30
expect-title About TikuSDR
expect-windows 3
expect-pixel 300 200 c3c88d
key Escape
wait 20
expect-no-title About
expect-windows 2
click-window TikuSDR
key Escape
wait 20
expect-no-title TikuSDR
quit
